! Test 13: OH radical UHF/LANL2DZ - numerical hessian (reference)
!
! Reference (1 thread, reference netlib BLAS/LAPACK,
!            default %hrr_mode auto -> contracted for this basis):
!   Total energy: -75.386294236425 Ha
! v0.95.0: per-quartet dispatch leaves this reference unchanged.
! With %hrr_mode primitive the historical -75.386294236419 is
! reproduced bit-exactly (floating-point regrouping only, v0.91.x).
! Compare with test12
%method  HF
%basis   lanl2dz
%ecp     lanl2dz
%job     freq
%hess_method numerical
%spin    unrestricted
%mult    2
*geometry angstrom
 O    0.000000    0.000000    0.000000
 H    0.000000    0.000000    0.970000
*end
